{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Boss 选招｜流程子图\nA–C 当前实现。类关系见 [[GGYGO_结构_BossAI.canvas|结构图]]；[[计划_BOSSAI]]。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1690,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "tick",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "1. BehaviorTree 到达选招任务，读 BossState 的当前 Form/Phase。\n\nUE BT 调 ChooseBossAction::ExecuteTask；读取 BossState::GetCurrentFormTag/GetCurrentPhaseTag 与目标 Blackboard。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 351,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "candidates",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "2. ActionSet 给出 ActionTag 候选及权重；按距离、角度、可激活性过滤。\n\n遍历 BossActionSet 动作；按 Form/Phase、距离/角度筛选，再调 ASC::CanActivateAbilityByHandle(Handle, FailureTags)。",
      "x": 480,
      "y": 351,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "random",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "3. BossAIController 的确定性随机流抽取候选，记录选择。\n\n调用：BossAIController::GetActionWeight / DrawActionWeight(Total) / RecordActionSelection；选中 ActionTag 写 Blackboard。",
      "x": 980,
      "y": 351,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "request",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "4. 激活任务用 ActionTag 找对应 GA，向 BossState ASC 申请激活。\n\n调用：ActivateAbility::ExecuteTask 从 ActionTag 找 SpecHandle → ASC::TryActivateAbility(Handle)，登记结束委托。",
      "x": 1480,
      "y": 351,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "execute",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "5A. 成功：GA 驱动 Montage / Trace / GE；任务等能力结束。\n\nGA::ActivateAbility → Montage Task/Trace/GE；BTTask::HandleAbilityEnded 对同一 Handle 收尾并返回结果。",
      "x": 1480,
      "y": 824,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "fail",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "5B. 拒绝或无候选：BT 走失败/其他动作，不在任务里直接造成伤害。\n\n无候选或 TryActivateAbility=false → EBTNodeResult::Failed；OnTaskFinished/CleanupBinding 防残留回调。",
      "x": 980,
      "y": 824,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "3"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "e1",
      "fromNode": "tick",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "candidates",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "ResolveCurrentActionSet(Form/Phase)"
    },
    {
      "id": "e2",
      "fromNode": "candidates",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "random",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "CanActivateAbilityByHandle=true"
    },
    {
      "id": "e3",
      "fromNode": "random",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "request",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "DrawActionWeight → Blackboard ActionTag"
    },
    {
      "id": "e4",
      "fromNode": "request",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "execute",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "TryActivateAbility=true → 等 OnAbilityEnded"
    },
    {
      "id": "e5",
      "fromNode": "request",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "fail",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "TryActivateAbility=false → Failed"
    },
    {
      "id": "e6",
      "fromNode": "candidates",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "fail",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "候选为空 → ClearValue / Failed"
    }
  ]
}
